    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1026">

                <pb facs="0895" n="779" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg779"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/17019.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Collector Cobb to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 27, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Obregon today mustering out former Villa soldiers in Juarez, with apparent entire
                    success.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cobb</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
